---
import OnePager from '../layouts/OnePager.astro';
---

<OnePager
  lang="de"
  title="Fabio Steyer — Data Analytics, Automatisierung, KI-Anwendung"
  description="Physiker (M.Sc., TU Berlin) mit produktiv eingesetzter Prozessautomatisierung und KI-Anwendung. Projekte, Belege, Kontakt."
>
<div class="page">
  <a class="skip" href="#start">Zum Inhalt springen</a>
  <div class="depth"></div>
  <div class="depth-up"></div>
  <div class="mist mist-a"></div>
  <div class="mist mist-b"></div>
  <div class="grainy"></div>

  <div class="rail" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="rail-fill"></div>
    <div class="rail-head"></div>
    <span class="stop s1" style="top: 2%;"><b>START</b></span>
    <span class="stop s2" style="top: 28%;"><b>ARBEITSWEISE</b></span>
    <span class="stop s3" style="top: 62%;"><b>PROJEKTE</b></span>
    <span class="stop s4" style="top: 85%;"><b>HINTERGRUND</b></span>
    <span class="stop s5" style="top: 97%;"><b>KONTAKT</b></span>
  </div>

  <div class="shell">

    <header class="topbar">
      <span class="brand">Fabio Steyer</span>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="#arbeitsweise" class="spy n2">Arbeitsweise</a>
        <a href="#projekte" class="spy n3">Projekte</a>
        <a href="#hintergrund" class="spy n4">Hintergrund</a>
        <a href="#kontakt" class="spy n5">Kontakt</a>
        <a href="/en/" class="mono" hreflang="en" lang="en">EN</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="progress"></div>
    </header>

    <main id="inhalt" style="position: relative;">


      <!-- ============ START ============ -->
      <section id="start" class="hero">
        <div class="wrap sink">
          <span class="eyebrow">STATION 01 · DATA ANALYTICS · AUTOMATISIERUNG · KI-ANWENDUNG</span>
          <h1>
            <span class="line l1"><span>Wo Daten fließen,</span></span>
            <span class="line l2"><span>zeige ich, <em>was ankommt</em></span></span>
            <span class="line l3"><span>und was verloren geht.</span></span>
          </h1>
          <p class="lede reveal">Physiker (M.Sc. TU Berlin, in Abschlussphase) mit produktiv eingesetzter Prozessautomatisierung im Unternehmen. Ich analysiere gewachsene Abläufe, entscheide je Prozessschritt zwischen Skript und Sprachmodell und trage die Lösung vom Prototyp bis in den laufenden Betrieb.</p>
          <div class="cta-row reveal">
            <a href="#projekte" class="cta">Belege ansehen <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
            <a href="#kontakt" class="ghost">Kontakt aufnehmen</a>
          </div>
          <div class="scroll-hint"><i></i>SCROLLEN — DEM FLUSS FOLGEN</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="flow-break" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 3000 130" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <g class="wave-scroll"><g class="wave-drift"><g class="wave-bob">
            <path d="M0 46 C 200 10, 400 82, 600 46 S 1000 10, 1200 46 S 1600 82, 1800 46 S 2200 10, 2400 46" ></path>
            <path d="M0 74 C 200 38, 400 110, 600 74 S 1000 38, 1200 74 S 1600 110, 1800 74 S 2200 38, 2400 74"></path>
          </g></g></g>
          <g class="wave-scroll-rev"><g class="wave-drift-slow"><g class="wave-bob-slow">
            <path class="p-b" d="M0 100 C 200 66, 400 134, 600 100 S 1000 66, 1200 100 S 1600 134, 1800 100 S 2200 66, 2400 100"></path>
          </g></g></g>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <!-- ============ ARBEITSWEISE ============ -->
      <section id="arbeitsweise">
        <div class="pipe-band">
          <div class="wrap sink">
              <span class="eyebrow reveal-l" style="margin-bottom: 18px;">STATION 02 · DER FLUSS EINES BELEGS DURCH DIE PIPELINE</span>
              <div class="stage reveal" style="margin-top: 18px;">
                <div class="stage-head">
                  <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--muted);">DER STROM LÄUFT DURCHGEHEND</span>
                  <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted);">Cavator · rund 3.000 Belege</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stage-body">
                  <svg class="rails" viewBox="0 0 1220 300" role="img" aria-label="Drei Belegströme laufen in Parsing und Matching zusammen und kommen geprüft heraus">
                    <path d="M40 60 C 300 60, 300 150, 560 150 L 1180 150" stroke="rgba(243,237,228,0.1)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"></path>
                    <path d="M40 150 C 300 150, 300 150, 560 150 L 1180 150" stroke="rgba(243,237,228,0.1)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"></path>
                    <path d="M40 240 C 300 240, 300 150, 560 150 L 1180 150" stroke="rgba(243,237,228,0.1)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"></path>

                    <path class="pipe-line" d="M40 60 C 300 60, 300 150, 560 150 L 1180 150"></path>
                    <path class="pipe-line" d="M40 150 C 300 150, 300 150, 560 150 L 1180 150"></path>
                    <path class="pipe-line" d="M40 240 C 300 240, 300 150, 560 150 L 1180 150"></path>

                    <g class="st st-1">
                      <text x="26" y="38" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#f3ede4">Rechnungen (PDF)</text>
                      <circle cx="40" cy="60" r="7" fill="#0f2a24" stroke="#d98a4f" stroke-width="2"></circle>
                      <text x="26" y="128" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#f3ede4">Angebote (PDF)</text>
                      <circle cx="40" cy="150" r="7" fill="#0f2a24" stroke="#d98a4f" stroke-width="2"></circle>
                      <text x="26" y="218" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#f3ede4">Großhändler-Preisdaten</text>
                      <circle cx="40" cy="240" r="7" fill="#0f2a24" stroke="#d98a4f" stroke-width="2"></circle>
                    </g>

                    <g class="st st-2">
                      <rect x="520" y="118" width="80" height="64" rx="2" fill="#0f2a24" stroke="#d98a4f" stroke-width="2"></rect>
                      <text x="560" y="146" text-anchor="middle" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#f3ede4">Parsing</text>
                      <text x="560" y="162" text-anchor="middle" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#f3ede4">Matching</text>
                    </g>

                    <g class="st st-3">
                      <text x="560" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#a9b7ad">Skript, wo es reicht — Sprachmodell nur, wo nötig</text>
                    </g>

                    <g class="st st-4">
                      <circle class="halo" cx="1180" cy="150" r="9" fill="none" stroke="#9fd3b8" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
                      <circle class="halo halo-2" cx="1180" cy="150" r="9" fill="none" stroke="#9fd3b8" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
                      <circle cx="1180" cy="150" r="9" fill="#9fd3b8" stroke="#9fd3b8" stroke-width="2"></circle>
                      <text x="1180" y="104" text-anchor="end" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#f3ede4">geprüfter Abgleich</text>
                      <text x="1180" y="122" text-anchor="end" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="10.5" fill="#a9b7ad">Abweichungen markiert, nichts geht verloren</text>
                    </g>

                    <circle class="beleg b1 k1" r="5" fill="#efc79f" opacity="1"></circle>
                    <circle class="beleg b1 k2" r="3.5" fill="#efc79f" opacity="0.75"></circle>
                    <circle class="beleg b1 k3" r="4.2" fill="#efc79f" opacity="0.9"></circle>
                    <circle class="beleg b2 k4" r="5" fill="#efc79f" opacity="1"></circle>
                    <circle class="beleg b2 k5" r="3.5" fill="#efc79f" opacity="0.75"></circle>
                    <circle class="beleg b2 k6" r="4.2" fill="#efc79f" opacity="0.9"></circle>
                    <circle class="beleg b3 k7" r="5" fill="#efc79f" opacity="1"></circle>
                    <circle class="beleg b3 k8" r="3.5" fill="#efc79f" opacity="0.75"></circle>
                    <circle class="beleg b3 k9" r="4.2" fill="#efc79f" opacity="0.9"></circle>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="caption-row">
                  <div class="cap cap-1"><b>01 — Analyse</b>Gewachsene Abläufe lesen, bevor etwas automatisiert wird.</div>
                  <div class="cap cap-2"><b>02 — Werkzeugwahl</b>Je Prozessschritt entschieden: Skript oder Sprachmodell.</div>
                  <div class="cap cap-3"><b>03 — Prototyp</b>Mit Tests, die das Ergebnis messen statt es zu behaupten.</div>
                  <div class="cap cap-4"><b>04 — Betrieb</b>Rund 3.000 Belege im laufenden Abgleich bei Cavator.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ MESSWERTE ============ -->
      <section id="messwerte" style="padding: 4vh 0 2vh;">
        <div class="wrap sink">
          <div class="kpis">
            <div class="kpi rise-up">
              <div class="num" style="color: var(--copper);"><span class="pre">rund</span><span class="count" style="--to: 3;" data-fallback="3"></span>.000</div>
              <span class="lab">PDF-BELEGE ABGEGLICHEN, CAVATOR</span>
              <span class="src src-betr">BETRIEBLICH — NICHT ÖFFENTLICH EINSEHBAR</span>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi rise-up">
              <div class="num"><span class="count" style="--to: 4;" data-fallback="4"></span> / 4</div>
              <span class="lab">EINGEBAUTE ABWEICHUNGEN GEFUNDEN</span>
              <span class="src src-oeff">ÖFFENTLICH NACHRECHENBAR</span>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi rise-up">
              <div class="num"><span class="count" style="--to: 38;" data-fallback="38"></span></div>
              <span class="lab">TESTS GRÜN, BEIDE REPOSITORIES</span>
              <span class="src src-oeff">ÖFFENTLICH NACHRECHENBAR</span>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi rise-up">
              <div class="num" style="color: var(--sage);"><span class="count" style="--to: 0;" data-fallback="0"></span></div>
              <span class="lab">VERLUSTE, KOORDINIERT GESCHRIEBEN</span>
              <span class="src src-oeff">ÖFFENTLICH NACHRECHENBAR</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="flow-break" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 3000 130" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <g class="wave-scroll-rev"><g class="wave-drift-slow"><g class="wave-bob-slow">
            <path d="M0 58 C 240 96, 420 20, 660 58 S 1080 96, 1320 58 S 1740 20, 1980 58 S 2280 96, 2400 58"></path>
          </g></g></g>
          <g class="wave-scroll"><g class="wave-drift"><g class="wave-bob">
            <path class="p-b" d="M0 88 C 240 126, 420 50, 660 88 S 1080 126, 1320 88 S 1740 50, 1980 88 S 2280 126, 2400 88"></path>
          </g></g></g>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <!-- ============ PROJEKTE ============ -->
      <section id="projekte" style="padding: 2vh 0 4vh;">
        <div class="wrap sink">
          <div class="reveal-l" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <span class="eyebrow">STATION 03 · PROJEKTE</span>
            <span class="wipe" style="font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #c9d2cb; display: inline-block;">zwei Belege, öffentlich und nachrechenbar</span>
          </div>

          <div class="cards">

            <article class="card join-l">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;">
                <span class="repo">invoice-quote-reconciliation</span>
                <span class="stack">Python · pytest</span>
              </div>
              <h3>Rechnungen gegen Angebote prüfen</h3>
              <p>Abweichungen finden, ohne jede Position von Hand zu vergleichen. Synthetische PDFs mit bekannter Wahrheitstabelle als Prüfmaßstab — so ist messbar, was das Programm findet und was es übersieht.</p>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 320 70" style="width: 100%; height: 70px; display: block;" role="img" aria-label="Prüflauf: vier eingebaute Abweichungen, vier gefunden">
                <line x1="0" y1="60" x2="320" y2="60" stroke="rgba(243,237,228,0.12)" stroke-width="1"></line>
                <path class="spark" d="M0 48 L50 48 L60 16 L70 48 L120 48 L130 16 L140 48 L190 48 L200 16 L210 48 L258 48 L268 16 L278 48 L320 48"></path>
                <circle class="peak pk1" cx="60" cy="16" r="3.5" fill="#efc79f"></circle>
                <circle class="peak pk2" cx="130" cy="16" r="3.5" fill="#efc79f"></circle>
                <circle class="peak pk3" cx="200" cy="16" r="3.5" fill="#efc79f"></circle>
                <circle class="peak pk4" cx="268" cy="16" r="3.5" fill="#efc79f"></circle>
              </svg>
              <div class="figures">
                <span><b>4</b> gepflanzt</span>
                <span class="hit"><b style="color: var(--copper);">4</b> gefunden</span>
                <span><b>0</b> Fehlalarme</span>
                <span><b>20</b> Tests</span>
              </div>
              <p class="limit">Grenze: synthetische Belege, keine echten Lieferantendaten. Kein Sprachmodell im Einsatz.</p>
              <a href="https://github.com/FabioSteyer/invoice-quote-reconciliation" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Repository ansehen: invoice-quote-reconciliation" style="align-self: flex-start; font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: auto;">Repository ansehen <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
            </article>

            <article class="card join-r">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;">
                <span class="repo">concurrent-file-writes</span>
                <span class="stack">Python · stdlib</span>
              </div>
              <h3>Wenn vier Prozesse dieselbe Datei schreiben</h3>
              <p>Paralleles Anhängen verliert Daten, ohne dass jemand es merkt. Der Vergleichslauf stellt naiv und koordiniert nebeneinander und misst den Unterschied.</p>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 320 70" style="width: 100%; height: 70px; display: block;" role="img" aria-label="Kette der Einträge: naiv mit Lücken, koordiniert lückenlos">
                <text x="0" y="8" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="8.5" fill="#a9b7ad">NAIV</text>
                <g class="chain lost" fill="#e4735a"><rect x="0" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 70.7% entry 86.7%;"></rect><rect x="16" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 67.4% entry 83.4%;"></rect><rect x="32" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 64.1% entry 80.1%;"></rect><rect x="64" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 60.9% entry 76.9%;"></rect><rect x="80" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 57.6% entry 73.6%;"></rect><rect x="112" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 54.3% entry 70.3%;"></rect><rect x="144" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 51.0% entry 67.0%;"></rect><rect x="160" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 47.7% entry 63.7%;"></rect><rect x="176" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 44.4% entry 60.4%;"></rect><rect x="208" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 41.1% entry 57.1%;"></rect><rect x="224" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 37.9% entry 53.9%;"></rect><rect x="240" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 34.6% entry 50.6%;"></rect><rect x="256" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 31.3% entry 47.3%;"></rect><rect x="272" y="12" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 28.0% entry 44.0%;"></rect></g>
                <g fill="#e4735a">
                  <rect x="48" y="12" width="12" height="12"></rect><rect x="96" y="12" width="12" height="12"></rect><rect x="128" y="12" width="12" height="12"></rect><rect x="192" y="12" width="12" height="12"></rect><rect x="288" y="12" width="12" height="12"></rect><rect x="304" y="12" width="12" height="12"></rect>
                </g>
                <text x="0" y="46" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="8.5" fill="#a9b7ad">KOORDINIERT</text>
                <g class="chain kept" fill="#9fd3b8"><rect x="0" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 28.0% entry 44.0%;"></rect><rect x="16" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 30.3% entry 46.3%;"></rect><rect x="32" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 32.6% entry 48.6%;"></rect><rect x="48" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 34.9% entry 50.9%;"></rect><rect x="64" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 37.2% entry 53.2%;"></rect><rect x="80" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 39.5% entry 55.5%;"></rect><rect x="96" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 41.8% entry 57.8%;"></rect><rect x="112" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 44.1% entry 60.1%;"></rect><rect x="128" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 46.4% entry 62.4%;"></rect><rect x="144" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 48.7% entry 64.7%;"></rect><rect x="160" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 51.0% entry 67.0%;"></rect><rect x="176" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 53.3% entry 69.3%;"></rect><rect x="192" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 55.6% entry 71.6%;"></rect><rect x="208" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 57.9% entry 73.9%;"></rect><rect x="224" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 60.2% entry 76.2%;"></rect><rect x="240" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 62.5% entry 78.5%;"></rect><rect x="256" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 64.8% entry 80.8%;"></rect><rect x="272" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 67.1% entry 83.1%;"></rect><rect x="288" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 69.4% entry 85.4%;"></rect><rect x="304" y="50" width="12" height="12" style="animation-range: entry 71.7% entry 87.7%;"></rect></g>
              </svg>
              <div class="figures grid4">
                <span><b>20</b>erwartet</span>
                <span style="color: var(--rust);"><b style="color: var(--rust);">14</b>verloren, naiv</span>
                <span style="color: var(--rust);"><b style="color: var(--rust);">18</b>Lücken in der Hash-Kette</span>
                <span style="color: var(--sage);"><b style="color: var(--sage);">0</b>koordiniert</span>
              </div>
              <p class="limit">Jeder Schreibvorgang trägt Vorher- und Nachher-Hash in ein Journal; eine Lücke in dieser Kette beweist, dass jemand außerhalb des Verfahrens geschrieben hat. Der Fehler zeigte sich erst im Vierprozesslauf — Einzelprozess-Tests liefen durchgehend grün. 18 Tests.</p>
              <a href="https://github.com/FabioSteyer/concurrent-file-writes" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Repository ansehen: concurrent-file-writes" style="align-self: flex-start; font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: auto;">Repository ansehen <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
            </article>

          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="flow-break" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 3000 130" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <g class="wave-scroll"><g class="wave-drift"><g class="wave-bob">
            <path d="M0 64 C 180 28, 380 100, 560 64 S 920 28, 1100 64 S 1460 100, 1640 64 S 2000 28, 2180 64 S 2340 88, 2400 64"></path>
            <path class="p-b" d="M0 92 C 180 56, 380 128, 560 92 S 920 56, 1100 92 S 1460 128, 1640 92 S 2000 56, 2180 92 S 2340 116, 2400 92"></path>
          </g></g></g>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <!-- ============ HINTERGRUND ============ -->
      <section id="hintergrund" style="padding: 2vh 0 4vh;">
        <div class="wrap sink">
          <span class="eyebrow reveal-l">STATION 04 · HINTERGRUND</span>
          <div class="three" style="margin-top: 28px;">
            <div class="note back-r bk1">
              <span class="when">05/2025 – 05/2026</span>
              <strong>Prozessautomatisierung, Cavator Bauausführung</strong>
              <p>Python-Pipeline für den Abgleich von rund 3.000 PDF-Rechnungen und -Angeboten; Dokumentengenerator; Extraktionsmodul für Großhändler-Preisdaten.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="note back-r bk2">
              <span class="when" style="color: var(--sage);">Führung</span>
              <strong>Bar-Leitung, Berndhain</strong>
              <p>Führung von zehn Mitarbeitenden, Tagesumsätze guter Wochentage um 30 bis 40 Prozent gesteigert.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="note back-r bk3">
              <span class="when" style="color: var(--sage);">TU Berlin</span>
              <strong>Physik</strong>
              <p>M.Sc. mit Schwerpunkt Theoretische Physik; B.Sc. abgeschlossen 2023 mit experimenteller Arbeit zu UVC-LEDs.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="reveal" style="margin: 28px 0 0; max-width: 66ch; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--muted);">Die Arbeitsprojekte sind betrieblich entstanden und deshalb nicht öffentlich einsehbar. Was davon öffentlich belegbar wird, steht unter Projekte. Ich arbeite mit KI-Werkzeugen, auch beim Bau dieser Seite; die fachlichen Entscheidungen, die Auswahl der Inhalte und deren Prüfung liegen bei mir.</p>
          <p class="reveal" style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-size: 14.5px;"><a href="/ueber-mich/#belege">Belegtabelle ansehen: was öffentlich nachprüfbar ist und was nicht <span class="arrow">→</span></a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ KONTAKT ============ -->
      <section id="kontakt" style="padding: 6vh 0 0;">
        <div class="wrap sink">
          <div class="contact">
            <div class="join-l last">
              <span class="eyebrow">STATION 05 · KONTAKT</span>
              <h2 style="margin-top: 18px;">Wenn Ihr Ablauf einen <em style="font-style: italic; color: var(--copper);">Engpass</em> hat, rechne ich ihn durch.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="fields join-r last">
              <div class="field"><span>E-MAIL</span><a href="mailto:steyerfabio@gmail.com">steyerfabio@gmail.com</a></div>
              <div class="field"><span>STANDORT</span><div>Berlin · Vollzeit · ab sofort verfügbar</div></div>
              <div class="field"><span>PROFIL</span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/fabio-steyer-795a0a200" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></div>
              <div class="field"><span>CODE</span><a href="https://github.com/FabioSteyer" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/FabioSteyer</a></div>
